Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, little friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been a hunter of peace, chasing\Nthe elusive mayfly known as love?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for many, many moons now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no rest for me\Nin my search of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meditate diligently every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The subjects are life and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I quit after three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my search for peace,\NI also train diligently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, friend, and farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:03:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've also made it my mission\Nto teach the precious value
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of peace to the children who\Nwill one day own the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cute. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash is being put in strangleholds\Nby the children again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a hunter of peace chasing\Nthe mayfly known as love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eileen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that you look so\Nmuch like my dead girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Michelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lovely name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.06,0:04:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of the outlaw was 60\Nbillion double dollars on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, what would you\Nsay to having lunch with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that we did all this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you could try harder
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But captain the strategy\Ndoesn't seem to be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we try something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Neil
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Neil, want to join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been a real quiet loner lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We invite him, but he never comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Vash,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just how long do you think you can perpetuate\Nthis self-indulgent lifestyle of doing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing but playing\Nwith children and eating
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sleeping without\Ndoing any work whatsoever?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eww, a lecture!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be pretty lame\Nto take that kind of abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on. Wait, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neil! Huh? Hi. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that wasn't a very warm hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you helping out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really good, Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, does your family run a restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can get me something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting any\Nhandouts. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my mom's off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom! Customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't wreck the place, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what are you doing here,\Npreacher man? Can't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lending a helping hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural to help those in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go. All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I feel like\NI'm taking advantage of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think nothing of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing it because I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it while it's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank heaven you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story, although\Nit's kind of short.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By chance, I had just stopped\Nby here to get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait a bit longer and I'll\Npay you the money I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady, you're way past your deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless you pay off your\Ndebt in full we can't make
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:07:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any money either and I don't\Nlike that so after that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to use a little\Nof his gospel to talk them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of it I asked the lady\Nwhat happened she said
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that her husband disappeared\Nleaving his debt behind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she decided to keep\Nthis place running even the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,child is desperate to help\Nhis mother in need it shot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me through the heart could\NCould you just sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you just ignore that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just awful. Yes? Just awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. Most definitely. Yes, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the most terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've saved me time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to go look for\Nyou once we closed shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The third annual quick draw tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grand prize, $50,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To help out a poor family, you're\Ngoing to compete. I will? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is show\Nup there on time tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the registration\Nand paperwork for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:07:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're helping these good people out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or would you prefer if I turned you in and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get the $60 billion\Ndouble dollars instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not very funny, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a sad face? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention beautiful. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For love and for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A quick draw tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on inside\Nthat pea-brained spiky head?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any normal person would be able to see the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,danger of participating\Nin such a stupid contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even enter the contest myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind of talked into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The priest we met on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, if you win the contest,\Nwill you treat me to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having unhappy visions here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see this scene in my head\Nof dozens of hot-shot gunmen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after the $60 billion double\Ndollars having a macho shootout war!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:09:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just taking part in a\Nfun contest, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't got a single clue, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you always say the strangest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chief says the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I just thought I should let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were going through today's\Nentries, this name came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a most troubling turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I have this entry withdrawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt that the\Nlegendary gunman would come
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of hiding for a mere\N$50,000 double dollar prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.40,0:09:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a wannabe punk\Nusing the name for kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.08,0:09:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just let him try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll know if he's the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will hold the tournament as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is all. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think will this do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me. Door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady gave us a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care for a swig?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't really mean to force you into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you planned it from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but I apologized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The church?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said earlier that\Nyou came from a church.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 300 miles from the city of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bring orphans that\Nfar out into the boonies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only place I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids I've met on the way,\Nwith nowhere else to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,either their parents are\Ndead or they abandon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, you know, there's kids like Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't want to take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go, smiling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to listen through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for eavesdropping,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least now I understand a\Nlittle better, Mr. Vash. Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it appears that you were\Nforced this time, I wish you guh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She means good luck, Mr. Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give him heck, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's drinking? I am! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let her have\Ntoo much, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lighten up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I feel so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't do that here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.74,0:11:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go, big girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your clothes back\Non right now! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we got in some\Namazing gunmen this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a load of that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Vass and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood haven't arrived yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you saw how they were last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll take their own sweet time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's probably better if they\Ndon't draw too much attention anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please keep your voice down, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really a wuss, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you handle a few drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a few drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was more like a few dallins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vash! Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna help my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neil, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't ask you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're all friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm not too bad at\Nthis sort of thing, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash is in the tournament. He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a lost cause to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the man you spoke of?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I hit them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Vash the Stampede, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm standing out too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it'll make the going\Nthat much easier, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep knocking them dead out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for you too. Huh? Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the third-round\Ncontestant, Mr. Nicholas D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood, is present and ready to compete,\Nstep forward now or be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you sign me up for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if we both compete,\Nit'll improve our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Priest Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For love and peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we have to\Nlive in a dangerous world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for self-protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're an ex-gunman. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.60,0:14:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid this is\Nthe end of your spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time you ain't\Nshooting no liquor bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time is live, one-on-one combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you didn't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I drop out now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dragged me into this with\Nyou and now it's too damn late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very lucky, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good at changing trajectories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't like seeing\Npeople kill each other, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, you're the one\Nwho dragged me into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will now commence the\Nfirst quarterfinal match.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you and me, spineless coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go easy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice...shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was facing backwards\Nthe whole time. Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far we haven't had a single\Nfatality in this year's contest. Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the real Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're cool enough\Nto join our club, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wolfwood just told me that he's going\Nto step out of the competition so i
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess that means now you've won this\Ncontest for sure isn't that wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm nicholas d wolfwood i'm\Nwithdrawing from the final round
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really but you were doing so\Nwell for yourself may i ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh it's too much of a bother that's all\Njust give the prize to the other guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right i can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.62,0:17:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what? look? huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well now that's how it is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicholas, you really are very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you consider eliminating Vash the\NStampede with your superb gunmanship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do as I ask, I will guarantee\Nyou the safety of that family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd even be willing to raise the\Nprize to 30 billion double dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean 50-50?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like a man with a head on his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, the final round will now begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you go over there to withdraw?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the big money question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what do you see in the\Nwindow of that building over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that just about sums it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for the good of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just resign yourself and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that we all have\Nto make a few sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.38,0:18:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I make a different one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is what you got me\Nso plastered for yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd\Ntry something that cheap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you went and signed\Nme up without asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did the same to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the sixty billion double dollars is\Nall mine how fortunate now finish them off
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.01,0:20:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw me my luggage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give it a push!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, whatever happens,\Nthou shalt not kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let any more children suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.28,0:20:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to go and\Ninjure so many of these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a churchman are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's dead. I kept my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mister, may the Lord\Nhave mercy on your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or do you intend to pay me\Nthe prize money after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then. I'll pay it. I'll pay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure has become awfully popular\Nall of a sudden, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was no ordinary priest,\Nbut I had no idea how unusual he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hit you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, heck, think nothing of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Neil?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.22,0:22:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess my job is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, sure looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.48,0:22:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For love and peace. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A choice between two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A forked road, a cross road, where men\Ngiven life must take in order to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whichever end they live\Non, they lose something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.40,0:24:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whichever end they live on, they\Nare unable to find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, are there really only\Ntwo paths to a forked road?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, there are infinite paths we must take.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.16,0:24:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is more than one path.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.28,0:24:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is more than one path to the future.

